WEBVTT

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:14.990
I'm no good for anything 
but killing, he said.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.990
I want to prove to myself 
that he was wrong.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.990
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.990
<b>Let's Go 
Flower Gazing!</b>

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.790
You want me to save a 
spot for flower gazing?

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:26.710
Yeah.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.230
I want to take the Agency 
flower gazing again,

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.510
but the spot nearby gets really crowded.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.380
Could you do it?

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.130
Sure.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.110
I'll find us a good spot.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.170
Great. Thanks.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.240
I shall endure until my body withers.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.390
That's grim.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:46.310
I got here early 
so I can do it right.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.000
Look at me, working hard 
for the Agency's sake.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.180
I'm going to get a lot of praise for this.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.640
Well done, Atsushi!

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.220
Thanks for the lovely flower 
gazing, Atsushi-kun!

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.920
Yay! Yay!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.530
Atsushi-kun's the star for today!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.150
It's already pretty crowded, though.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.380
Where's a good spot?

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:02.790
<b>Stop</b>

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.080
<b>Ba-blam</b>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.630
Kyouka-chan?!

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.760
Wh-Why are you here?

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.960
I heard yesterday that we needed 
to save a spot for flower gazing.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.950
Then you must have heard the part 
about me doing it, too, didn't you?!

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.340
It's okay.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:19.130
I'm good at waiting.

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:21.600
That's not okay at all!

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.600
<b>Long ago...</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.600
<b>She waited an eternity
 for Dazai Osamu</b>

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:24.720
By the way, when did you get here?

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.080
<b>Ha!</b>

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:27.100
Yesterday evening.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:32.600
I'm going to get a lot of praise for this.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.080
I'm technically supposed 
to be the senior here.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.160
What's that?

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.690
I made plenty of lunch boxes.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:42.860
Why so perfect?!

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.460
Tower of Grub!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.500
<b>Bam</b>

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:46.170
Eh?

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.010
Tower of Grub.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:49.750
Why repeat yourself?

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.690
It's a pun on <i>Tower of Go</i>—

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.860
Okay, I got it! Stop!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.630
I was looking forward to it.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.010
I was looking forward to flower gazing.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:11.990
Kyouka-chan.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.410
Thanks.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:21.720
<i>That day, we enjoyed flower gazing together 
for a while, before the others arrived.</i>

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.250
Why do we have to sit next to <i>these</i> guys?!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.160
It's quite the situation, indeed.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.080
Especially as I can see 
Kyouka having so much fun.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:41.160
My adorable Kyouka.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.900
Kyouka, the greatest snack of all!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.690
Man, she's completely wasted.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:51.350
<i>You</i> were the one who saved 
our spot, weren't you?!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:54.190
<b>Spot-Saver</b>

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.180
I-I'm sorry! I didn't realize!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:58.210
Although I thought I overheard someone
 saying "Dazai-san! Dazai-san!"

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.700
That's a dead giveaway!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.950
Damn it, this sly bastard 
is going to ruin my drink.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.690
Yeah, right.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:07.270
You're actually a total lightweight.

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:08.740
What?! What was that?

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:09.710
I can drink!

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.060
Why are you even flower gazing, anyway?

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.920
It's none of your business where I go!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.730
Our flower gazing trip is 
going to turn into a war!

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.770
Please, do something!

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:20.330
Today is the day I kill you, Dazai! Bring it!

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.720
U-Um...

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.710
N-Now that we're all here flower gazing,

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:30.940
why don't we make it a joint event 
between the Agency and the Port Mafia?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.500
Just kidding.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.210
Just a second!

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.310
Akutagawa-san looks happy!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:37.320
Hold it!

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:40.230
Who would ever have a joint 
event with <i>this</i> guy?!

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.930
We're getting out of here!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.230
He's blatantly upset!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.530
Pack up, right now!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.140
This is 
delicious

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.560
We're moving!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.560
Try some,
Hirotsu-san

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.780
Chuuya-san passed out!

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.130
<b>Passed Out</b>

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.120
He must have been enjoying himself.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.660
We finally have some quiet.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.370
Why don't we enjoy our banquet 
in honor of the cherry blossoms?

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.860
Oh, you.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.450
<i>And so the party continued.</i>

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.070
<i>With Nakahara Chuuya's 
hangover becoming all but certain,</i>

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.770
Senpai!

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:34.650
Shut up, Ichiyo!

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:37.270
<i>we partied through the night.</i>

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.340
<b>Wan!</b>

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.340
Wan! Shorts.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.340
<b>Shorts</b>

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.630
We have to stop them, quickly!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.300
Kyouka-chan, let's stop them together!

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:50.620
But how?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.080
I heard you can stop fights between wild 
animals by obscuring their vision.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.480
That's all it takes?

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.450
Nice.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.880
Sake

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.880
Wine

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.880
Whiskey

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.880
Drugstore

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.880
Daily Needs            Drugs            Cosmetics

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:14.620
<b>Synopsis</b>

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:14.620
<b>The Agency's bathtub broke down, 
forcing the members
 to go to the public baths.</b>

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.340
<i>The Agency's bathtub broke,</i>

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:13.510
<i>forcing the members to 
go to the public baths.</i>

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.620
What a crappy explanation!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.380
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.380
<b>To The Baths!</b>

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:22.000
Is it really a good idea for so many 
of us to go to the baths together?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.900
There's something we all have 
to work together to stop.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:26.740
Was there an incident or something?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.720
Yay! Bathtime at the huge baths!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.590
Oh, this is what we need to stop!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:35.780
Hey, Kenji-kun, want to have 
a crawl race in the tubs?

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.700
That sounds great. Let's do it.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:38.410
Kenji-kun!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:38.410
Kenji!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.040
We're here to stop Rampo-san.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.520
Oh, right.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.410
Get it together.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.270
Crawling is a nuisance 
to other customers.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.770
We can't do that.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.610
Let's have a breast stroke race, then.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:51.830
Sure, we can do that.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.660
Kenji-kun!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.660
Kenji!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.940
Yay!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.120
Sheesh.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.730
What are we to do with these seniors?

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.740
Right, Kyouka-chan?

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.320
<i>Is Kyouka-chan planning to 
play in the bathtubs, too?</i>

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.160
<i>As her senior, I have to give her a warning.</i>

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.990
Rampo-san gave these to me.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:08.640
We're going to be separated 
into male and female baths.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.000
How sad.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.070
I want to go with you, Onii-sama.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.430
Th-That's not an option, Naomi.

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:20.240
In that case, you should come 
with me to the female baths.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.560
Th-That's even worse!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.320
No!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.290
Bathtub Handstand Therapy!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:24.650
Yeah?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.510
Standing on your hands in a 
bathtub improves your health.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.230
Huh.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.480
My ass, Dazai!

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:30.560
Stop pestering me with nonsense!

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.150
Hot Bath Suicide By Drowning Therapy!

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:33.560
Oh?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.450
Committing suicide by drowning in 
a hot bath improves your health.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.300
Oh.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.130
My ass, Dazai!

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.260
You'd die!

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.350
Sauna Cold Water Bath Therapy!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.760
Going back and forth between a sauna 
and a cold bath improves your health!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.450
Ah.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.510
My ass!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.500
There's no way that actually exists!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.390
It does.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.300
<b>Opinions Vary</b>

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:51.800
Really?

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:53.760
I dunno.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.790
You...

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.530
Didn't you bring anything, Dazai-san?

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.710
Great question, Atsushi-kun.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.720
I plan on borrowing everything.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.770
I have nothing to lend you.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:08.840
Don't be mad at me, Kunikida-kun!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.840
Get off me. You're annoying.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:09.460
Um...

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.510
Would you like to borrow mine?

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.110
Thank you, Atsushi-kun!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:14.870
Although...

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:18.910
I wash my whole body with just a 
bar of soap, including my hair.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:24.080
<b>Poof</b>

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.790
<b>Tiny</b>

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.670
That's the way it was at the orphanage.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:24.090
You can be pretty wild sometimes, huh?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:29.090
<b>Poof</b>

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.110
I think I'll pass.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:40.730
<b>Synopsis</b>

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:40.730
<b>With the bath broken 
at the Port Mafia headquarters, 
the only way to bathe 
is to go to the public baths.</b>

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.840
<i>With the bath broken at the 
Port Mafia headquarters,</i>

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.570
<i>the only way to take a bath 
is to go to the public baths.</i>

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:40.720
How's that any different from the Agency?!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.070
That sounds fine to me.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.420
It's nice to take a bath in a 
big bathhouse once in a while.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.130
Right, Elise-chan?

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:52.110
At least, that's what the boss says,

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.340
but there's no way the Mafia can 
just walk into a public bath house.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:55.920
Right?

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:02.430
If only Chuuya-san were with us, though...

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:04.950
You're here?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.330
I mean, with your ability...

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.880
Special Ability: Ideal Body Weight!

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.800
I could control my body weight as I like.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.300
Although, I'd need you to come 
to the female baths for that.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.600
Are you mental?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.620
I'm kidding.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.740
The baths, huh?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.860
<b>Ahaha</b>

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.860
<b>Ahahaha</b>

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:27.720
Well, as long as that dumbass isn't there.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.550
I guess I'll go.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:33.100
Chuuya-san, you've forgotten your shower cap.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.620
What are you talking about?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:35.910
There.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.110
Your fancy hat.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.570
You look great.

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:41.460
Damn you!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.000
I don't need this!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.730
And for you, Akutagawa-senpai...

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:45.120
Cough.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.240
Have this.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:52.980
Moisturizing lotion, body cream, 
aroma oils, and supplements.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.220
And be careful not to catch 
a cold after you get out.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:55.620
No.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.630
Hey! Senpai!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:08:59.150
No.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:02.130
What do you mean, "No"?!

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.390
Say, I was thinking...

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.930
You know how Akutagawa-san's special 
ability makes his coat change?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.040
Do you think he becomes really 
exposed when he's taking a bath?

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.650
<b>Hmm... 
Good point</b>

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.780
Guys, how dare you?!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.380
Sorry, I was just kidding.

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:27.080
Akutagawa-senpai's strong, 
even if he's buck naked!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.340
Even if he's buck naked!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.590
Even if he's buck naked!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.610
Even if he's buck naked!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.200
L-Let's stop, before we get in trouble.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:44.020
<i>I'm here with Gin, but I wonder 
if she's actually a woman.</i>

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.300
<i>I have to find out with my own eyes.</i>

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.980
<b>Shall 
we share?</b>

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.630
Shall we share?

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.200
<i>She's a girl!</i>

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.250
<i>More than I needed her to be!</i>

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:02.330
<i>She's a girl!</i>

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.890
We have to stop them!

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:35.690
Hey, Akutagawa, let's take
 our seniors back home.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.970
You aren't Dazai-san's junior.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:41.770
That doesn't matter! 
We have to stop them!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.940
It does matter!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:44.980
I'm going home.
